# Wild Ride cast from the hand ({R}, a sorcery) goes to the graveyard when it resolves and asks for no creature to tap: harmonize is
# only a way of casting it from the graveyard (CR 702.180a). Bot1 casts it for its harmonize cost, {4}{R}, choosing to tap no creature
# (CR 702.180a: "up to one"), so all five mana is paid and neither creature is tapped. It resolves, the Ornithopter gets +3/+0, and the
# card is exiled instead of going to the graveyard (CR 702.180a).

